From c6351e57b2077dc63d463e00bbd830f88562a784 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Starwey <moonbite233@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:30:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: ar0234: add DECXIN 720p two-lane vendor profile

Select the exact vendor RAW10 initialization with decxin,3478v1. Preserve ordered register writes and startup delays, constrain its endpoint to two lanes and continuous clock, and expose its 1280x720 timing and control defaults.
---
 drivers/media/i2c/ar0234-decxin-3478v1.h | 184 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/media/i2c/ar0234.c               | 187 +++++++++++++++++------
 2 files changed, 328 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/ar0234-decxin-3478v1.h

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/ar0234-decxin-3478v1.h b/drivers/media/i2c/ar0234-decxin-3478v1.h
